warning[juxtaposition]: `1/2x` means `1/(2x)`
 --> positive.jl:2:19
  |
2 | half_inverse(x) = 1/2x
  |                   ^^^^ parsed as `1/(2x)`
  |                     -- one factor
  |
  = why: juxtaposition binds tighter than `/`; readers often read left to right
  = fix: replace with `1/(2x)`   [safe]
  = docs: corset explain juxtaposition
  = note: warn from readability group, library preset
  = note: opt out with `# corset: allow juxtaposition -- <reason>`

